{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Type to Sleep</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help her sleep by typing out her thoughts each night. Every keystroke brings her one step closer to a good night\u2019s rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/e58abc86a5a4be194117ea55f2bb8397.poster.avif?t=1768652274\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/e58abc86a5a4be194117ea55f2bb8397.webm?t=1768652274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/e58abc86a5a4be194117ea55f2bb8397.mp4?t=1768652274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Choices Matter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before bedtime, you\u2019re presented with a dilemma from work during the day and a few choices to resolve it the next day. Your decisions will affect how easy or difficult bedtime will be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/0acc7f96b37b9938493c96098d8a7537.poster.avif?t=1768652274\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/0acc7f96b37b9938493c96098d8a7537.webm?t=1768652274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/0acc7f96b37b9938493c96098d8a7537.mp4?t=1768652274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Things to Expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A precision-based typing game where accuracy and speed matter. The more typos you make or words you miss, the more her stress builds until she can\u2019t sleep at all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An extensive vocabulary of everyday words for you to type, helping build your muscle memory. Includes at least 5,000 words with lengths up to 12 characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing lo-fi soundtrack to serenade you as you type.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty settings for every skill level, so you can play at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape each night\u2019s difficulty. Dodging your own responsibilities might get you through a stressful night, but helping others makes the path ahead easier.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714440?t=1768652274","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/abc3a1555dde760a0e5fb6a8febf60d178be67f7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768652274","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/3a855375b7b827fa15b150c32695c2647fdfb7fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768652274","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/3a855375b7b827fa15b150c32695c2647fdfb7fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768652274","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4092800,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Type to Sleep</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help her sleep by typing out her thoughts each night. Every keystroke brings her one step closer to a good night\u2019s rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/e58abc86a5a4be194117ea55f2bb8397.poster.avif?t=1768652274\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/e58abc86a5a4be194117ea55f2bb8397.webm?t=1768652274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/e58abc86a5a4be194117ea55f2bb8397.mp4?t=1768652274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Choices Matter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before bedtime, you\u2019re presented with a dilemma from work during the day and a few choices to resolve it the next day. Your decisions will affect how easy or difficult bedtime will be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/0acc7f96b37b9938493c96098d8a7537.poster.avif?t=1768652274\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/0acc7f96b37b9938493c96098d8a7537.webm?t=1768652274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/extras/0acc7f96b37b9938493c96098d8a7537.mp4?t=1768652274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Things to Expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A precision-based typing game where accuracy and speed matter. The more typos you make or words you miss, the more her stress builds until she can\u2019t sleep at all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An extensive vocabulary of everyday words for you to type, helping build your muscle memory. Includes at least 5,000 words with lengths up to 12 characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing lo-fi soundtrack to serenade you as you type.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty settings for every skill level, so you can play at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape each night\u2019s difficulty. Dodging your own responsibilities might get you through a stressful night, but helping others makes the path ahead easier.</p></li></ul>","developers":["SkilZent"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714440/2e7ae3830ec8a3b4711a212954b980032244b21b/header.jpg?t=1768652274","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3714440/741136745/ca15d1b77cbb7a5dcdd17c68e37a29c84631632a/1756862609/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756873767","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3714440/741136745/ca15d1b77cbb7a5dcdd17c68e37a29c84631632a/1756862609/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756873767","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3714440/741136745/ca15d1b77cbb7a5dcdd17c68e37a29c84631632a/1756862609/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756873767","id":257192404,"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257192404/ac4915705bcc83200e171ed34eb1962fb363abb3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756873767"}],"name":"Type Her to Sleep","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (For Steam)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> You can *probably* run this on a potato.</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["SkilZent"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0"